      <body><head><ref n="8787" target="https://papyri.info/editions/bgu/1/342"><title>BGU 1 342</title><date>1895</date></ref></head><div xml:lang="grc" type="edition" xml:space="preserve"><ab>
    <lb n="1"/>ἔτους πρώτου καὶ εἰκοστοῦ Μάρκου Αὐρηλίου Κομ<supplied reason="lost">μό</supplied>δου 

